<title>PERU: PERU'S JAN-JULY CEMENT OUTPUT RISES 10.84 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>PERU'S JAN-JULY CEMENT OUTPUT RISES 10.84 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's cement output was 2.371 million tonnes in the first seven months of the year, up 10.84 percent from the same period last year, the private Association of Cement Producers (ASOCEM) said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The principal producers were Cementos Lima, with 1.085 million tonnes, and Cementos Norte Pacasmayo with 467,287 tonnes.</p>
<p>Peru produced 3.848 million tonnes of cement throughout 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
